      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Prynhawn da. Mae gen i stafell… dan yr enw Jones.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7f3c3fff-ebba-4609-8a48-15f6831a0ef7",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Croeso. Dewch ar fy ôl i,… os gwelwch yn dda. Dyma'r bwydlenni.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8080c64c-dada-4005-8452-9ad946b86bef",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Prynhawn da. Mae gen i stafell wedi'i bwcio dan yr enw Jones.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "87e39d6c-0d40-4875-bcb8-c29f198a1bf2",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Pump. Deg. Pymtheg. Coch. Gwyrdd.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8928e387-c575-4386-ab59-115906ff47dd",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Efo salad gwyrdd bach i ddechrau.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8badddca-6a5e-498b-9eae-046709f5991e",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Gest ti ddiwrnod hir?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "907e49a9-6618-4497-aa47-36a4507ecbc9",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Ydy popeth yn iawn? Oes gynnoch chi le am bwdin?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "917b2577-8385-4bb0-9156-82f2a6493e94",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Dw i'n meddwl… dy fod ti'n gwneud… yn dda iawn. Dw i wedi synnu. Dw i'n meddwl… dy fod ti'n barod… i ddechrau siarad Cymraeg… efo unrhyw un… sy'n siarad Cymraeg.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "93f21158-1296-49cc-9243-551658d94071",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Ardderchog.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "95c0369c-75fa-4514-949a-3e9efe650a9e",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Triwch barasetamol at y cur pen, a'r losenni yma at y gwddw.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "96fd51d3-dda5-4683-b483-995d3fa0dc27",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Ydi hi'n iawn… i'w cymryd efo bwyd?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9a383a03-fc26-4096-b02e-81e0e557b6a5",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Bore da. Dau Americano… a phaned o de,… os gwelwch yn dda.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9a72b30c-9779-4f91-82dc-eb38b1f9de9f",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Ardderchog. Ydy hi'n bosib i ni gael check-out hwyr?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9db45f84-31f7-4cc1-b3e8-826c5e69cc29",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Ydw, ga i wydraid o ddŵr hefyd, os gwelwch yn dda.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9fd7ad31-42cb-4dca-bb82-a47a23699cc5",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Ga i weld y rhestr gwin? Dw i isio gwydrad o win.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a018c461-1235-4b6f-9795-49f0dbecad36",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Wela i chdi bryd hynny.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a323aece-5ff7-43af-bf12-3a74d6ecd2be",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Na, mae'n ddrwg gen i, dw i'n brysur fory. Ond gawn ni siarad ddydd Sadwrn. Wela i chdi bryd hynny.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a37a587b-b327-4bcb-90d6-503d7af775d5",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Medrwch, wrth gwrs. Mae'r peiriant yn fan hyn.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a70756ca-dd41-4e2c-ae58-5e258ed48371",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Yndi, efo bwyd… neu ar ôl bwyd sydd orau.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a9559bdb-515d-4b54-93c4-69f16dd8a353",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Dyma fy mhasbort i.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aa64362e-984f-489f-848d-ab1562c46540",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Oes gynnoch chi contactless?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ae2c0fd1-1009-457a-84e3-7d5d97a917ea",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Helo, noswaith dda!",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b0f67e78-3480-4538-9dea-9b098ff44101",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Miliwn. Wyth deg. Naw deg. Dau o'r gloch. Deg o'r gloch.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b54f47c4-d6a9-47d2-a25b-8de83c2180d9",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "A'r risotto i mi.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b6e0684b-881e-4e2f-9aa3-b2e93713a63e",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Wrth yr ail gylchfan,… cymrwch yr allanfa gynta.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b7ad88ae-9c58-442f-99dd-9df808503f27",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Mi fasen ni'n licio un botel o ddŵr pefriog ac un botel o ddŵr llonydd, os gwelwch yn dda.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ba0d384d-576c-4f69-a232-15695fd71899",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Dw i'n dda iawn, diolch.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ba2df779-7e75-4efb-8c72-fa5864a03f85",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Un deg naw. Dau ddeg. Dau ddeg un. Dydd Mercher. Dydd Iau.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bf6bb423-5944-4622-936e-f6b4a74a739a",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Mae hon yn ddinas hyfryd. Be dach chi'n 'neud?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c12d0097-f768-4a43-9c86-2a69fae833a2",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Oes gan y stafell olygfa?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c5163aeb-0d38-4c3a-93b8-cdd2eb2c9f6b",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Mae'n ddrwg gen i,… wnes i ddim eich dallt chi. Dw i'n dysgu Cymraeg. Fedrwch chi ddeud hynna… eto'n arafach?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cad099e9-ca76-4fe5-9db7-06d893202593",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Mae hynna'n garedig iawn! Ydw,… dw i yma ar wyliau,… a dw i angen ymarfer… mwy i siarad Cymraeg yn well. Diolch yn fawr, a hwyl.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cb6f0ad8-7679-42ab-8e2e-9abf8db9d9bd",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Wyt ti'n mynd i'r gwaith?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cd66d279-c22f-423e-90cd-b87d2b169c4d",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Ydw i'n siarad… yn ddigon araf… i chdi rŵan?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cff05c0f-ce10-4347-8d03-d758793cea3d",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Diolch. Ac oes gynnoch chi… dabledi lladd poen i blant?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d3f35b06-8b9f-4210-8595-9cb2b398af71",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "A'r risotto i mi. Efo salad gwyrdd bach i ddechrau.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d3fe2e0a-f1d2-4ad6-9216-79c8890d2449",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "A be ydy cyfrinair y wifi?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d9a95b45-2033-4600-adae-295b707a76b2",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Noswaith dda, Sarah.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "da519751-3356-4192-8053-200d2ba3480f",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Mi fasai potel o win coch y tŷ yn hyfryd.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dcbaf775-8516-4b01-8341-24917c822b49",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Oes gynnoch chi frechdanau?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e224128d-e2a3-4bb1-a742-5cedb2b3f240",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Ia,… heibio'r eglwys a'r… swyddfa bost.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e560e325-ef1d-432f-bf7a-ddb127b16e26",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Cant. Dau gant. Mil. Dydd Sul. Deuddeg o'r gloch.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e9da848b-5cd3-43ed-ba76-2bfe2f3ec982",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Pedwar. Chwech. Wyth. Glas. Melyn.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ea6d3e88-4a26-4189-9038-466454f95bc0",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Pa mor aml ddylwn i gymryd… y parasetamol?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ec23f6c5-cbc6-48e0-9264-a3382783e101",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Pedwar o'r gloch. Wyth o'r gloch. Mawrth. Ebrill.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f070f10f-a04c-4437-9230-a0bd44b95048",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Oes… mae'r eog a'r risotto… heb glwten,… y ddau ohonyn nhw. Mae gynnon ni saladau… hefyd.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f21ddd60-3bdb-42c7-bb1a-ba65d84a66cd",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Dewis ardderchog. Mi ddo i â hi draw rŵan.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f44238b2-af98-4d5f-bd6c-303b68d36d24",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Wrth gwrs. Be ydi'ch symptomau chi?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fb18a170-876a-4229-af4a-3282203b2d29",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Ga i ddau goffi gwyn a dau goffi du ac un o'r rheina, os gwelwch yn dda?",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fbb059ba-9af8-4e02-8284-ce6f2a6c7a69",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Oes, mae 'na un ar y stryd fawr,… wrth ymyl y becws.",
      "before": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fd23dc20-cbbf-4049-9098-6a64497ba8d8",
      "action": "would-flag",
      "course": "cym_n_for_eng",
      "voice": "human_aran_cym_n_2",
      "role": "target1",
      "text": "Liciwn i ddau wydraid arall o gwrw.",
      "before": null
    }
  ]
}